{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"Meanwhile, in the etherial plane: ||The blink bug's metamorphosis is complete, and it emerges from its cocoon as Web is freed from their stone in the material plane. Such a small amount of the potion could not simply reverse the damnation put in place by Solomon. So instead, it had to modify the transformation. Rather than the blink bug feeding on Web's essence to become more powerful and sinister, it and Web underwent a simultaneous transformation. Web's change was simply to remove the stone and irritated throat, but it had an peculiar, and as yet unknown effect on the blink bug.||","created_at":"2020-08-14T17:56:15.314000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743890748709011477","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
